<article class="article-view post-full error-404">
    <div class="error-404-box">
        <img class="error-404-ico" src="<%- url_for('/image/icon/topic/faq.webp') %>" alt="">
        <div class="error-404-code">404</div>
        <h1 class="error-404-title">找不到此页面</h1>
        <p class="error-404-desc">
            你要访问的页面可能已被移动、删除，或从未存在过。<br>
            请检查地址是否正确，或从下面回到熟悉的地方。
        </p>
        <div class="error-404-actions">
            <button type="button" onclick="location.href='<%- url_for('/') %>'">返回首页</button>
            <button type="button" onclick="history.back()">返回上一页</button>
            <button type="button" onclick="location.href='<%- url_for('/archives') %>'">浏览全部文章</button>
        </div>
    </div>
</article>
